WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
I know this cold voice

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Taking my friend

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
But right now...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.000
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.000
For the moment...

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:20.000
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.000
You're going to meet three men,

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.000
men I've chosen.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:44.000
You will choose one to be your partner in life.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:51.000
It's a game. Whether you play is up to you.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.000
I'm in.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
"Circling Love"

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.000
My Dad... why'd he start this 'husband' game?

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.000
Is this why he took me off the island?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.000
He shut me up there with no explanation.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:25.000
Then, suddenly, it's back to the world, to New York.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:26.500
Kajika...

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:32.000
He said I could choose what to do, so I went to Japan, but now this?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.000
No one made you agree to his game.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.000
You did that on your own.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.000
Pretty cold, Lee-Leng.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Until you choose a husband, I'll stay with you.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.000
That's the deal I made with Harry.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:59.000
What about the company? Aren't you the head of the Huang Group?

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:03.000
Yes, so all I have to do is to give orders.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:07.000
Lee-leng! I'm sorry I called you cold.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.000
But this decision won't be easy.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:17.000
I know I'll be okay, as long as you're here.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.000
It will be like your love for Mustafa.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.000
For Mustafa...

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:36.000
You can call what I felt for Mustafa "love,"

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.000
but I don't believe I'll ever feel that again.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:44.000
At first glance, we understood each other.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:48.000
We were happy just to spend the whole day curled up together.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.000
What I loved most was just watching Mustafa walk.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.000
The beauty of it made words catch in your throat.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.500
It was beyond words.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.000
For that moment, time stood entirely still.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.000
When Mustafa died...

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.000
if you hadn't been there for me, Lee-Leng,

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.000
I would have died, too.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:18.000
Love has many forms.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.000
Someone will come along whom you can love even more than Mustafa.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.000
It's impossible.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.500
Half of humanity is male, Kajika.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.800
There's a wider world out there to see.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.500
I really just want to go back to Japan.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.590
I didn't even get to explain things to Yui.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.000
I had to give up my friend.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.000
Kajika, you could say you live in different worlds...

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.000
...but it wouldn't matter.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.000
Look me in the eyes!

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:16.000
You gotta really look at me!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.000
She looked straight at me with those silver eyes as she said it.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:28.000
She was never one to sugar-coat her criticism.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.000
That was ten years ago...

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.000
Over and over I came back to visit her,

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.500
the island girl who lived with a leopard.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.000
Somehow, as Kajika grew up,

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.000
she became my own private sleeping beauty.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.000
And now...

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:58.000
I have to watch her choose another man.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.000
Turning your only daughter's marriage into a game?

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.200
What is Mr. Burnsworth thinking?

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.000
An ordinary guy like me wouldn't get it.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.000
Why are you whispering?

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.000
But wait, miss. If you get married,

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:28.000
the whole Burnsworth empire goes to you and your husband, right?

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.000
You might get a lot of schemers after you.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.000
Your bodyguard will have to stay pretty sharp!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.000
Think so?

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:42.000
You're totally defenseless, miss!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:46.000
Raising you on a remote island didn't protect you.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.000
If you ask me, it did the opposite!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.000
Toranosuke, you're like an old man,

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.000
despite your baby face.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.000
Stop calling me baby face!

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:58.000
Hurry up and age.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.000
I plan to.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.700
I want to be as impressive as Master Lee-Leng.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.000
Lee-Leng... he's late.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.000
Is that it for the papers I need to look over?

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.800
Yes.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.000
Good.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:16.000
Also, Master Tonsen wishes for your immediate return to Singapore.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.000
Uncle Tonsen?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.000
You're overseeing the marriage of Miss Kajika,

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.000
at the request of Mr. Burnsworth.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.000
It seems word has gotten out.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:31.000
Master Tonsen seems to feel it was hasty,

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.500
handing you full control of the Huang.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:38.000
That's foolish. It was the family's will.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.000
No one can oppose the family's will.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.330
Whatever Master Tonsen says,

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:49.000
the family around the world will look to you.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.000
My father often told me,

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:56.000
"Master Lee-Leng is like a whip:

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:01.000
Flexible, but with an unbreakable strength."

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.000
How is everything?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.000
Dessert is ready in the courtyard, if you wish.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.000
Is it in the sun? Yes.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.910
Let's go! Hurry, Toranosuke!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.000
Miss Kajika!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.500
Kajika, what is it?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:28.550
Kajika?

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.200
Mustafa...

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.000
Mustafa?

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.000
After 12 years of searching,

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.000
I've chosen these men.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:10.000
Each one is fascinating, like a brilliant gem.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.000
You will know them when you meet them.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.000
He's gorgeous.

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.000
Could it be? Is he the first?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.000
Mustafa!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.000
Wait, Kajika.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.600
Let me go! Mustafa has come back!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.000
What are you saying, Miss Kajika?

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.000
Mustafa?

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.000
Mustafa.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.000
Where did you go?

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.000
Mustafa!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.000
Mustafa!?

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:31.000
Kajika, Mustafa is gone.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.000
Don't you say that!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.000
Kajika...

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.000
No, no, no!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.000
You mustn't grieve like this, Kajika.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.000
Maria...

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:45.000
This way Mustafa can't go to heaven.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.000
I don't want him to!

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.000
Even if he's a spirit, I want him here with me!

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:51.900
You must not say such things.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:55.000
Your grief will bind the spirit;

00:10:55.000 --> 00:11:00.000
so, instead of heaven, it will enter a living soul.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.000
It's a terrible thing.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.000
No, it's not!

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.000
It's the belief on Givoli,

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.100
the island where Kajika was raised.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.000
If the grief of the one left behind is too strong,

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:18.000
the spirit can't enter heaven.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.000
It finds the spirit that most resembles it,

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.550
and enters their body instead, hoping to return.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:29.000
Kajika really believes that superstitious stuff?

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:34.000
Beliefs stay strong in a remote place like Givoli.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.000
Kajika was cared for by Maria, a local woman,

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:40.000
and she still carries her influence.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:46.000
So she thinks Mustafa's spirit is in that man?

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.000
Hey, what's that?

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:52.000
The investigator's report.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:58.000
"Eugene Alexandr De Volkan"

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:01.000
Volkan? As in Volkan Group?

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:05.000
Yes. The third son of Baron Volkan.

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.000
Aren't they the leading financial group in Europe?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.000
And they're aristocrats, too.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.000
Certainly, he meets the requirements.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.200
But something... something's off.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.000
There's no feeling in those cold eyes.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.000
His face is like a mask.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:31.000
Did Harry really choose that man?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:37.000
He sent Miss Kajika into a daze, for sure.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.000
If he is really a candidate,

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:43.000
she'll never have left her island prison.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:47.000
You don't really know Kajika yet.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:53.000
Kajika stands on her own, wherever she is.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.000
This is like the bottom of the sea.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.000
The crowds are like schools of fish,

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:05.000
rushing past without affecting each other.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:12.000
But look -- the schools of fish are disturbed.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:17.000
By silver fur, and eyes flecked with topaz.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.000
It's him...

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.000
my Mustafa.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.470
He finally found me.

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.000
Welcome home!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.500
Have we met?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.000
We met long ago.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.000
It must have been someone else.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.000
You know me, too. You've just forgotten.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:48.000
I'd like to call you by your other name. May I?

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.000
What is that?

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.000
Mustafa.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:57.000
It's a nice name, but I'm sorry to say

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.000
I've never heard it before.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.000
It's the name of the leopard I loved.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:05.000
His spirit is in you now.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:08.000
I have no interest in religion.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:13.000
All the same, you are Mustafa.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:18.000
Remember... somehow, remember!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.000
Eyes flecked with green and gold.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.000
Mustafa's eyes.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:29.000
It must be true.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:33.000
There can't be another person with these eyes.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.000
It's me, Kajika. I'm Kajika!

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:41.000
Kajika? Kajika Burnsworth?

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:47.000
Excuse me. Miss Kajika has gone.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.000
Somehow she got through the window.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.000
Aren't there dogs in the garden?

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.000
They all know her.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:58.000
I know where she went.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.000
To Volkan's apartment.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.000
You told her where it is?

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:06.000
It's not like I could keep it from her.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:11.000
But I told her she couldn't see him until the investigation was complete.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:18.700
Oy, you mean Miss Kajika chose that man over your orders?

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:22.800
She's really attached to this Mustafa guy.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:26.000
Excuse me.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:30.000
Our investigation turned up something serious.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:34.900
Volkan has driven three women to suicide.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.000
Have a seat anywhere.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:57.500
You really live here?

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.000
Yeah, why?

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:04.000
It feels like a catalogue. It doesn't feel lived-in.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.500
Maybe I don't want it to be lived in.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:13.000
You make it sound like you don't want to live.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:20.000
But there are two spirits inside of me.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.000
Right?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.000
Right.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:32.000
Even if I wanted to live, having two spirits would tear me apart.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.000
But that could be interesting, too.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.000
Maybe that's what an evil spirit would do,

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.000
but not Mustafa.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:44.000
Your spirits will come together.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:48.400
Heh. Reincarnation, I've heard of...

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.500
but this spirit stuff is news to me.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:55.000
It's the faith of Givoli. Maria taught me about it.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.000
Who's Maria?

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:01.000
Someone special. The Caribbean woman who raised me.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.000
I'd heard of a remote Caribbean island,

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:07.000
where Burnsworth hid his beloved daughter away. But...

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.000
You know!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.000
Did you remember, Mustafa?

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:18.000
Everyone in the business world knows that.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:23.000
The truth is, Volkan is a sub-group under Burnsworth.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:26.000
My father's affairs are none of my business,

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:30.000
but I can't have you firing anyone without cause.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.000
That's the only reason I let you in.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.000
That's a lie.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:40.500
Running a business on personal feelings would be a disaster.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:43.000
I understand that, and I'm a kid.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.920
There's no way you don't know it too.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:48.800
This girl...

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:53.820
So if I make you angry, it won't affect Volkan?

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.000
Of course.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.510
Well, then, my name is Eugene.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.180
Not Mustafa.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.230
You hate being called Mustafa?

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:06.000
I can't say I enjoy it.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.000
I'll stop then.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.000
He smiled!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.020
Just for a moment,

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:18.000
but you do know how to smile, Mustafa.

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:19.880
I can't rush it.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:24.000
Back then, it took months to become friends

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:26.280
What?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:34.210
Eugene! You'll die with me!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.470
No!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:40.000
Get away! This has nothing to do with you!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.000
Move aside, Kajika.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.400
Eugene!

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.860
Like she said, it has nothing to do with you.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:50.000
Where were you and Sally Carter last night?

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.620
I know about the others! I found out everything!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.710
Why?

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.500
Eugene, why?

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:03.250
Our love was so deep!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:06.000
I don't recall mentioning love.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.460
I couldn't have,

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:13.000
because there's never been anyone I loved.

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:16.090
Please, just say it.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:20.660
Even if it's a lie, tell me you love me, Eugene!

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:23.000
Please, don't say any more.

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:27.000
Can't you see his feelings in his face?

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:31.000
I can't do that.

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:40.000
I'll kill you!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.840
We'll die together!

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:46.000
Go ahead and shoot, but forget about 'together.'

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.040
When I die, it will be alone.

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:54.000
Your egotistical sentimentalism isn't for me.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.450
His arrogance...

00:19:56.640 --> 00:20:00.000
it's beautiful somehow, but so sad...

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:02.000
It feels like...

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:07.000
the first time I met Lee-Leng -- just the same.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:09.080
Make your choice.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:14.000
Who will die here? Me?

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.000
You?

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.400
Reese?

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.000
Let me go!

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:31.650
Lee-Leng!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.480
Take her away.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.490
To where?

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:37.840
To calm her down.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.000
Let's get you out of here, too, Miss!

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.000
No!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:45.460
Open your eyes, Kajika! That's not Mustafa!

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:48.300
You're not just Kajika's watchdog.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:52.000
You're Lee-eng, leader of the Huang Group.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:56.000
I've heard your home in Singapore is just Burnsworth's Eastern branch.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:21:01.190
Perhaps there's more truth to it than I thought.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:05.460
The better question is, what are you doing?

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:10.000
Heir to Volkan, wasting your life in dissipation?

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:11.840
Maybe this mess was my answer.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.250
I don't know what you mean.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.690
Letting your womanizing get to blind love...

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:22.000
that takes a prize idiot.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:23.650
Keep wasting your time.

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:27.520
But bear in mind that you're trespassing right now.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.000
Let's go, Kajika.

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.000
Even Master Lee-Leng can be jealous.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:55.000
I think I hit a nerve.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:57.700
Don't see that man again.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:01.000
Why not? Dad chose Eugene, didn't he?

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.000
What, choose that murderer?

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:04.680
Murderer?

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:08.160
He's already led three women to suicide.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:14.000
Eugene goes where the current takes him.

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:18.000
He didn't want them to die or to die himself.

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:22.000
But he doesn't want to live either.

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:30.000
He doesn't care if he lives or dies.

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:33.000
And as for love...

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:36.000
I've got it.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:39.000
It's exactly the same.

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:42.200
That's how you were when we first met.

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:00.140
You've made an enemy, my Chinese friend.

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:08.000
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:16.000
so I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:23.000
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:28.000
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:38.000
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:45.000
Whether sleeping now or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:52.000
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:59.000
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:07.000
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts.

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:14.000
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:24.000
In those arms, in that breast, I'm alive.
